---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { GUEST_AUTHORING } from '../consts';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who writes RealFin and why.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lede">Hi, I'm Fin (RealFin online). I run a home server that does far more than it probably should.</p>
    <p>It started as a place to keep movies and grew into a full homelab: a media server, network-wide ad blocking with my own DNS resolver, Home Assistant with Zigbee sensors, a password manager, a local AI chatbot, and game servers for my friends (Valheim and a few Minecraft modpacks).</p>
    <p>Everything on this site comes from that machine. When I write that something broke, it broke on my server, and the fix is the one I actually used. I don't publish anything that would make my own network easier to attack: no IP addresses, no hostnames, no screenshots of admin panels. You'll get the ideas and the configs, not a map of my house.</p>
    <p>I'm also building a Roblox game with AI as a coding partner, and I'm writing that up as I go: what the AI is good at, where it confidently gets things wrong, and how I keep a game secure against exploiters.</p>
    <h2>Where to start</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/homelab/">My homelab</a>: the hardware and every service on it.</li>
      <li>Series: <a href="/blog/valheim-dedicated-server-docker/">Running a Valheim server for friends</a>, <a href="/blog/adguard-unbound-network-adblock/">Home DNS</a>, <a href="/blog/homelab-health-check-checklist/">Keeping a homelab healthy</a>.</li>
      <li><a href="/tools/">Free tools</a>: Valheim modifier generator, DNS record checker, Docker Compose port checker.</li>
      <li><a href="/blog/building-this-blog-astro-cloudflare-pages/">How this site is built</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/category/homelab/">Homelab</a>: Docker, DNS, backups, smart home, local AI.</li>
      <li><a href="/category/game-servers/">Game servers</a>: hosting Valheim and Minecraft for friends.</li>
      <li><a href="/category/roblox/">Roblox dev</a>: building a game with AI.</li>
    </ul>
    {GUEST_AUTHORING && <p>RealFin is also open to guest authors with their own first-hand stories. See <a href="/write/">Write for RealFin</a>.</p>}
    <p>Questions or corrections? See the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
